Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:28.20,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}out.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think distribution is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,a moat, and I think it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:05.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,has gotten much harder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.47,0:00:06.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,like I think the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:06.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,internet has gotten much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,noisier, and so you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:09.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,to find something that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:09.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,makes you stand out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,and again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:12.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,maybe it's blogs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.17,0:00:12.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,maybe it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:13.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.67,0:00:14.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Twitter maybe it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,something else
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:16.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,maybe it's the crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:17.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,branding stuff that we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:18.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,do. There's kind of a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,reason why that stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:20.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,works, right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,because it stands out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:23.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,And so I think if you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:25.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,trying to be early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have to find a hook
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,that kind of makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,and it's different.
